WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Kule Pro reads stock, order, supplier and invoice data.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Built for planners, buyers and managers.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The model does not decide alone. Data is validated first.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Every row is checked against a contract. Bad rows are kept, not lost.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:01:05.000
172,765 rows, 0 rejected, about 8 s. Public data.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Numbers are checked against Kule's own calculation. The checker is code.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:32.000
The format gate stops off-task output. Every step is traced.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Approval is given on a summary. If it does not match, the action stops.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Python: 229 and 87 tests. Node: 29 tests, all passed.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:02:08.000
Eval replays recorded cases. Real model: 16 of 20 runs accepted.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Goods receipt, delivery notes, invoices and production not measured. No proof of company need yet.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:33.000
Known limit: a reworded leak and a scale error can pass the checks.

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:45.000
A decision-support tool. People make the final call. Numbers and limits are on the evidence page.
